P3	S4	□(¬good_will → fortune_pride)
# "can never" is read as necessity.
P4	S5	□(¬good_will → ¬pleases_spectator)
# The unstated link: if a being is worthy of happiness, an impartial spectator takes pleasure in seeing it prosper.
A1	-	□(worthy → pleases_spectator)
# "indispensable condition" is read as a necessary conditional.
